          "caption": "A closer view of the gorgeous red-gold Buddhist art on the ceiling and walls of the external walkways around the beautiful wat located right inside the gates of the LP National Museum. Most of these bas reliefs appear to depict various aspects of the life of the Buddha. (Luang Prabang, Laos/ Lao PDR, April 2014)",
