          "filename": "Those 'nagas' (serpents) look pretty formidable! (14625503293).jpg",
          "caption": "A closer look at the naga (serpent) themed balustrade ends on one of the staircases of the wat like structure just inside the grounds of the LP Royal Palace and National Museum. They look pretty formidable, don't they? (Luang Prabang, Laos/ Lao PDR, April 2014)",
