        {
          "path": "_m/w/7/8/9/royal-palace-luang-prabang-wp/long-shot-of-the-main-museum-b.jpg",
          "filename": "Long shot of the main museum building (14582442616).jpg",
          "caption": "A long shot of the LP Royal Palace, which is now the main display building of the LP National museum. I did go in there, but as with everywhere else in Laos, photography is strictly prohibited inside, and they make you check your camera in before you enter. And a large Nikon D90 dSLR is not something you can hide in your pocket! The no photo rule appeared to be strictly enforced as well, for apart from making you check in your camera, there are several volunteers inside keeping out an eagle eye for violators. (Luang Prabang, Laos/ Lao PDR, April 2014)",
          "alt": "A long shot of the LP Royal Palace, which is now the main display building of the LP National museum. I did go in there, but as with everywhere else in Laos, photography is strictly prohibited inside, and they make you check your camera in before you enter. And a large Nikon D90 dSLR is not something you can hide in your pocket! The no photo rule appeared to be strictly enforced as well, for apart from making you check in your camera, there are several volunteers inside keeping out an eagle eye for violators. (Luang Prabang, Laos/ Lao PDR, April 2014)",
